      "mergedPostDetails": "It would be nice if we could save avatars that we have currently equipped. Logging out then back in will let you keep your previous avatar, so what about completely saving them to the avatar menu? Obviously if the creator marks the world as private or removes the avatar, you would then be unable to use it, but it would be nice to not have to go all the way to a world just for one avatar and then back again.",
